is disk today.** 💡 **REUSABLE, and it is a new axis for the streak's own question: nineteen fires have asked *how can this subject set come back EMPTY?* — a throw, a guard, a `catch`, a stale tree, a cwd, a filename. This one is never empty and never wrong; it is COMPLETE OVER THE WRONG AXIS. When two instruments jointly "cover" a concern, ask what each one SELECTS ON, not what each one scans — two honest tools partitioned on orthogonal keys leave a hole neither can report, and each will keep certifying its own half forever.**
